{"author":{"id":"dec876858d28babbadcead4137861bf586626b8518cbce9c5f4fc52ac3b424b8"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1795617658,"nonce":"+F5uashjzNgORIymMSizBqQXWoo=","title":"Code editor: replace never calls on_change, and the find bar has other faults","message":"blinc_layout's `CodeEditor` find and replace (crates/blinc_layout/src/widgets/code/search.rs and mod.rs) has these faults.\n\nConfirmed in the code\n- `replace_current` and `replace_all` change the text but the bar's buttons only call `notify_search`, which refreshes the search signal and the editor. `on_change` is not called, so an application that mirrors the text through `on_change` misses every replace.\n- Replace is literal: `replace_range(.., \u0026self.replace_text)`. In regex mode there is no `$1`, `$\u0026` or `$$` expansion.\n- A match is `(line, start_col, end_col)`, so a search cannot span lines.\n\nReported by a read-only survey, not run\n- Cmd+G, Cmd+R and Cmd+H refresh the editor but do not call `fire_search_signal`, so the bar's count, toggles and replace row may go stale.\n- The bar is a legacy `OverlayConfig::dropdown()` overlay placed once at the editor's top-right from `editor_bounds` captured on mouse-down. It does not follow a move or resize. A press in the editor may dismiss it. The docs say not to use it inside a `cn::popover`.\n- The query is not seeded from a single-line selection. Cmd+F with the bar open closes it and does not refocus the field.\n- While `search_active`, the editor ignores typed text and every non-modifier key but Esc.\n- An invalid regex gives no matches with no message. Whole word is ignored in regex mode. The doc comment on `execute_search` (\"starts with /\") is stale.\n- Tests cover typing and Enter in the field and the stylesheet look (`crates/blinc_layout/tests/code_find_field.rs`), but not replace, whole word or regex.\n\nFix order: `on_change` on replace and `$1` expansion first, with tests; then the signal refresh; then the rest as the cn wrapper (see its project issue) takes the bar over.","files":null}]}